{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "GOALS",
    "steam_appid": 2753000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/6ddf9cdba52890276fa61f41acc05a7e.avif?t=1751615415\" width=620 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOALS isn\u2019t just about playing, it\u2019s about mastering the game. Climb the ranks, score with style, and rise above the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redefining football games with a fast-paced, skill-driven experience that puts players in full control of their playstyle and destiny. Designed for everyone ready to step up, it\u2019s accessible on any platform and welcomes both newcomers and seasoned players alike. By building a fair, competitive ecosystem where effort and mastery are rewarded, GOALS inspires players to rise to the top and define the next era of football esports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/81765f0e4dd7c82c2556b13636b21bf4.webp?t=1751615415\" width=210 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your club, build your squad, and evolve together on the field. Every player is unique in both attributes and appearance. GOALS is easy to learn, but nearly impossible to fully master. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/55b529860e2d5bbe59b7873223d4ce79.avif?t=1751615415\" width=620 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/8b711f619c8c8d9906e093aaafbcb248.webp?t=1751615415\" width=177 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOALS is free to play*. Play matches to earn currency to use in store to generate players. Get new kits and celebrations. Keep the best players in your squad, and exchange the ones you don\u2019t want with Swaps. See your players progress and eventually retire to become club legends. You will also see some of your favorite real life footballers and celebrities featured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Applicable platform account and subscription (sold separately) may be required. This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire in-game items, including random selections of in-game items.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/c2a87545249d804fb583dbe46ae9ef25.avif?t=1751615415\" width=618 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/ed3a350be23eba7d683e481444b08e86.webp?t=1751615415\" width=171 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOALS supports cross-platform matches between Windows, PlayStation, and Xbox players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/48575a69f93b7600275cc2fb79986a34.avif?t=1751615415\" width=620 height=232 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/e6f138f3dfb2ba288c8a459520357b78.webp?t=1751615415\" width=283 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the thrilling 1v1 online mode or join forces with friends in the forthcoming 5v5 game mode. GOALS\u2019 Simulation Engine Technology (SENTEC) minimizes input delay to ensure an optimal gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/cef86ecd5db40c16e3f39496655ad307.avif?t=1751615415\" width=618 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/4d386b74046b8ad9972294bfb01e6026.webp?t=1751615415\" width=208 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in official esports tournaments with prize money. Prove that you\u2019ve got what it takes to become a champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/e4310297e23aa365bd66a068b1680ffa.avif?t=1751615415\" width=618 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/e41b990e95790b79f00929c18f10b5b3.avif?t=1751615415\" width=620 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your feedback and engage in the discussions at the GOALS Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>GOALS is still under development. The full game might have elements and assets absent in the alpha.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/6ddf9cdba52890276fa61f41acc05a7e.avif?t=1751615415\" width=620 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOALS isn\u2019t just about playing, it\u2019s about mastering the game. Climb the ranks, score with style, and rise above the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redefining football games with a fast-paced, skill-driven experience that puts players in full control of their playstyle and destiny. Designed for everyone ready to step up, it\u2019s accessible on any platform and welcomes both newcomers and seasoned players alike. By building a fair, competitive ecosystem where effort and mastery are rewarded, GOALS inspires players to rise to the top and define the next era of football esports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/81765f0e4dd7c82c2556b13636b21bf4.webp?t=1751615415\" width=210 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your club, build your squad, and evolve together on the field. Every player is unique in both attributes and appearance. GOALS is easy to learn, but nearly impossible to fully master. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/55b529860e2d5bbe59b7873223d4ce79.avif?t=1751615415\" width=620 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/8b711f619c8c8d9906e093aaafbcb248.webp?t=1751615415\" width=177 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOALS is free to play*. Play matches to earn currency to use in store to generate players. Get new kits and celebrations. Keep the best players in your squad, and exchange the ones you don\u2019t want with Swaps. See your players progress and eventually retire to become club legends. You will also see some of your favorite real life footballers and celebrities featured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Applicable platform account and subscription (sold separately) may be required. This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire in-game items, including random selections of in-game items.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/c2a87545249d804fb583dbe46ae9ef25.avif?t=1751615415\" width=618 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/ed3a350be23eba7d683e481444b08e86.webp?t=1751615415\" width=171 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOALS supports cross-platform matches between Windows, PlayStation, and Xbox players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/48575a69f93b7600275cc2fb79986a34.avif?t=1751615415\" width=620 height=232 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/e6f138f3dfb2ba288c8a459520357b78.webp?t=1751615415\" width=283 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the thrilling 1v1 online mode or join forces with friends in the forthcoming 5v5 game mode. GOALS\u2019 Simulation Engine Technology (SENTEC) minimizes input delay to ensure an optimal gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/cef86ecd5db40c16e3f39496655ad307.avif?t=1751615415\" width=618 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/4d386b74046b8ad9972294bfb01e6026.webp?t=1751615415\" width=208 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in official esports tournaments with prize money. Prove that you\u2019ve got what it takes to become a champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/e4310297e23aa365bd66a068b1680ffa.avif?t=1751615415\" width=618 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753000/extras/e41b990e95790b79f00929c18f10b5b3.avif?t=1751615415\" width=620 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your feedback and engage in the discussions at the GOALS Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>GOALS is still under development. The full game might have elements and assets absent in the alpha.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "GOALS is a gameplay-first, free-to-play, multiplayer focused and esports ready football game, currently in Alpha. Expect a responsive gameplay experience, designed to actually feel like football. Develop your club, build your squad and prove yourself on the pitch. To be the best, play the best.",
